li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我作为卖日用调料的商贩，对这个再清楚不过了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e大家从我这买走的香辛料数量，比其他所有调料加起来还要多！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哪怕再普通的食谱，只要加上须弥独特的香辛料，就定能获得新生！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于香料…】\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e同样的食材，只要加上香料，就马上变得不一样了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"csmbs0rz76jT1758034178307\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e那当然！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哎，口说无凭，你亲自尝尝便知。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e试试看，是不是比普通的奶酪更加香气四溢？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【获得\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"4640\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/08/31/75610764/cc2f1dc5dab4fd6eaa34f8f9dfeb0292_6398208316000774101.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"马萨拉芝士球\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"3\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4640/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4640/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/08/31/75610764/cc2f1dc5dab4fd6eaa34f8f9dfeb0292_6398208316000774101.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e马萨拉芝士球\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*3\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/16/288180982/b26706122e54335e75a99308e473cc62_2644509946774618742.png\",\"option\":\"【这么厉害？】——获得马萨拉芝士球*3\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e都是家家户户做菜会用的调料，我最推荐香辛料哦！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/16/288180982/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_1927267562978167694.png\",\"option\":\"【有什么卖的？】——打开商店界面\"},\"ri64v0adfxcT1758034128905\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e一定要试试用香辛料做菜啊！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【再见。】\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e【胜利】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔，以前听说过用香味作弊的手段…哈哈放心，我是不会用的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【失败】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哈哈哈，赢了！啊，因为不太擅长这个，所以偶尔能赢还挺开心的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/16/288180982/cc2a44c2e85425afbbd461e49fe0875d_6209955023916894202.png\",\"option\":\"【冒险挑战】——进行七圣召唤对局【牌手九级解锁】\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[\"csmbs0rz76jT1758034178307\"],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"ri64v0adfxcT1758034128905\"],\"csmbs0rz76jT1758034178307\":[],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"ri64v0adfxcT1758034128905\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1762222413","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id"